        "name": "data_quality_checks",
        "description": "Task 026: run the data-quality framework after gold is built, so quality history is populated every orchestrated run. Blocking check failures (schema, procurement completeness, procurement duplicates, referential integrity, lookup/grain uniqueness) raise DataQualityException and fail this activity, halting the pipeline; advisory checks are logged/scored to gold_quality_history only.",
